WEBVTT

00:06:58.414 --> 00:07:01.917
I'll show you, I'll show you.
I'm going to be the best.

00:07:01.959 --> 00:07:04.086
Girls can't dunk in a game?
I'll dunk twice.

00:07:04.128 --> 00:07:05.129
(Applause)

00:07:05.171 --> 00:07:07.798
You can't hold up an MVP trophy pregnant?

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.133
OK, I'll show you.

00:07:09.925 --> 00:07:13.012
You can't have a family,
a career and nurse your daughter.

00:07:13.053 --> 00:07:15.890
I came back nine weeks post-delivery
and I played in a game,

00:07:15.931 --> 00:07:18.225
and I nursed my daughter for 13 months.

00:07:18.225 --> 00:07:22.605
(Applause)

00:07:23.063 --> 00:07:25.608
You can't be on the cover of a video game.

00:07:26.734 --> 00:07:29.445
You can’t do a TED Talk as an athlete.

00:07:29.445 --> 00:07:30.988
(Cheers)